+```text
+deg_u R_0 <= deg_y Q = Ke,    deg_v R_0 <= deg_y P = Kd.
+```
+
+The leading form contributes `deg_u = M_R e` and `deg_v = M_R d`, so
+`M_R <= K`.  Hence every component multiplicity satisfies `m_i <= K`, and under
